this is the main function of the parser module</para>
<para>call parse list which wrap all the layers and check for EOF</para>
<para>parse_list (&quot;;&quot; and &quot;&amp;&quot; separators) -&gt; parse_and_or</para>
<para>parse_and_or (&quot;&amp;&amp;&quot; and &quot;||&quot; separators) -&gt; parse_pipeline</para>
<para>parse_pipeline (&quot;|&quot; separator) -&gt; parse_command</para>
<para>parse_command (read simple command) -&gt; parse_subshell</para>
<para>parse_subshell recurse on parse_list</para>
<para>parse_heredoc walk ast and collect heredocs</para>
